1
00:00:08,250 --> 00:00:09,833
Dear May Deer,

2
00:00:09,833 --> 00:00:11,667
With a lovely family,

3
00:00:11,667 --> 00:00:15,250
Dreaming of growing up each day.

4
00:00:15,250 --> 00:00:17,167
Shy Chuan-Chuan Pangolin,

5
00:00:17,167 --> 00:00:18,667
Quiet, with not a word to say,

6
00:00:18,667 --> 00:00:19,667
Curls up like a popcorn ball.

7
00:00:19,833 --> 00:00:20,083
Curls up like a popcorn ball.

8
00:00:20,583 --> 00:00:21,667
Curls up like a popcorn ball.

9
00:00:21,833 --> 00:00:22,333
Curls up like a popcorn ball.

10
00:00:22,333 --> 00:00:22,917
Don’t be shy!

11
00:00:23,083 --> 00:00:23,917
Don’t be shy!

12
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:24,500
Sing out loud!

13
00:00:24,667 --> 00:00:25,833
Sing out loud!

14
00:00:25,833 --> 00:00:27,417
Let your imagination shine!

15
00:00:30,583 --> 00:00:31,167
Good friends in the forest,

16
00:00:31,167 --> 00:00:33,083
Growing and playing together,

17
00:00:33,083 --> 00:00:34,000
Happy May Deer and Chuan-Chuan!

18
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:37,500
ODEER MAYO / Happy May Deer and Chuan-Chuan

19
00:00:37,676 --> 00:00:40,082
Off to School!

20
00:00:40,333 --> 00:00:44,833
It’s May’s first day of school. She has just gotten up and is getting ready for breakfast.

21
00:00:45,083 --> 00:00:47,417
Morning, May! Hurry and get ready.

22
00:00:47,417 --> 00:00:49,417
You don’t want to be late on your first day of school!

23
00:00:49,417 --> 00:00:51,917
Mom, what exactly is school?

24
00:00:51,917 --> 00:00:53,417
Can you eat it?

25
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:57,083
Haha! There are lots of fun things to do at school, May.

26
00:00:57,083 --> 00:00:59,083
And you’ll make lots of new friends.

27
00:01:00,333 --> 00:01:03,250
But I don’t know anyone at school.

28
00:01:03,250 --> 00:01:05,833
What if I miss you, Mom?

29
00:01:05,833 --> 00:01:07,333
Haha, don’t worry.

30
00:01:07,333 --> 00:01:09,000
Mommy will cast a little magic spell for you

31
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:11,000
to fill you with courage.

32
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:12,417
Zing, zap, boom!

33
00:01:12,417 --> 00:01:14,917
Sparkling stars, pop!

34
00:01:14,917 --> 00:01:16,583
There! All done!

35
00:01:16,583 --> 00:01:19,083
Put on this special magic bow I made for you.

36
00:01:19,083 --> 00:01:20,583
It’ll be just like I’m right there beside you.

37
00:01:20,583 --> 00:01:20,917
Mm-hmm.

38
00:01:22,167 --> 00:01:24,583
Mom walked May to the school gate.

39
00:01:24,750 --> 00:01:27,083
All right, May. Have a wonderful day at school!

40
00:01:27,083 --> 00:01:27,667
You’ve got this!

41
00:01:27,667 --> 00:01:28,667
Mm-hmm.

42
00:01:31,333 --> 00:01:34,000
May reluctantly said goodbye to her mom

43
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:37,083
and began her new life at school.

44
00:02:07,167 --> 00:02:08,500
Hello, everyone!

45
00:02:12,250 --> 00:02:13,583
Teacher Capybara!

46
00:02:13,750 --> 00:02:17,917
Since it’s our first day of school, let’s take a little roll call and get to know everyone.

47
00:02:18,083 --> 00:02:19,417
The teacher began calling the roll.

48
00:02:19,917 --> 00:02:20,750
Hei-Hei Bear!

49
00:02:20,833 --> 00:02:22,000
Hehehe!

50
00:02:22,167 --> 00:02:23,083
Pipi Monkey!

51
00:02:26,583 --> 00:02:29,833
And our exchange student from the West, Fox.

52
00:02:29,833 --> 00:02:31,917
You can just call me Little Fox.

53
00:02:31,917 --> 00:02:33,333
No problem!

54
00:02:39,500 --> 00:02:40,917
And here’s Chuan-Chuan from the park.

55
00:02:40,917 --> 00:02:42,583
And last but not least, May Deer.

56
00:02:43,333 --> 00:02:44,250
May!

57
00:02:44,333 --> 00:02:46,250
Here!

58
00:02:46,250 --> 00:02:50,917
Everyone’s here! Welcome to Capybara Preschool, kids!

59
00:02:50,917 --> 00:02:52,333
Next up is activity-center time.

60
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:55,500
You can explore the different corners of the classroom

61
00:02:55,500 --> 00:02:57,083
and make some new friends.

62
00:02:58,583 --> 00:03:00,333
At the teacher’s signal,

63
00:03:00,333 --> 00:03:02,833
the children happily went off to play.

64
00:03:02,833 --> 00:03:05,750
The reading corner has all kinds of interesting books.

65
00:03:05,750 --> 00:03:07,417
The block corner has all kinds of building blocks.

66
00:03:07,917 --> 00:03:10,500
But May was looking for her new friends.

67
00:03:18,417 --> 00:03:20,000
Hooray! We’re in the same class!

68
00:03:23,417 --> 00:03:24,333
Huh?

69
00:03:24,333 --> 00:03:25,667
What’s this?

70
00:03:25,667 --> 00:03:27,000
How cute!

71
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:30,083
This is the courage sticker Mom gave me this morning.

72
00:03:30,083 --> 00:03:32,833
She said it would help me feel brave at school.

73
00:03:32,917 --> 00:03:33,917
Oh, I get it!

74
00:03:34,167 --> 00:03:37,250
My mom put a magic spell on my bow this morning, too.

75
00:03:37,417 --> 00:03:40,083
It’s like having Mom right here with me.

76
00:03:40,333 --> 00:03:41,750
I have one too!

77
00:03:41,750 --> 00:03:42,500
Look!

78
00:03:42,667 --> 00:03:45,500
Mom gave me a lucky bracelet this morning, too.

79
00:03:45,500 --> 00:03:47,583
It brings me good luck!

80
00:03:47,833 --> 00:03:50,000
See? Isn’t it useful?

81
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:50,583
Mwah!

82
00:03:50,833 --> 00:03:53,417
You’re right! You do look luckier.

83
00:03:53,417 --> 00:03:53,750
I have one too!

84
00:03:54,250 --> 00:03:55,000
I have one too!

85
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:58,917
Chuan-Chuan, you’re blushing again.

86
00:03:59,417 --> 00:04:01,000
That’s because I love outer space.

87
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:05,583
Mom hung a little planet around my neck this morning

88
00:04:05,583 --> 00:04:08,833
so I can always feel close to the universe I love.

89
00:04:08,833 --> 00:04:10,583
Wow! Space is so cool!

90
00:04:10,583 --> 00:04:11,917
This is your planet.

91
00:04:12,333 --> 00:04:14,000
And these are our planets.

92
00:04:15,750 --> 00:04:19,417
Hehehe! We have something, too!

93
00:04:19,417 --> 00:04:22,417
My mom used a black bear’s blessing this morning

94
00:04:22,417 --> 00:04:24,917
to draw a symbol of victory on me.

95
00:04:24,917 --> 00:04:26,917
Wow! The goddess of victory!

96
00:04:26,917 --> 00:04:30,417
And Mom packed me a little honey, too.

97
00:04:30,417 --> 00:04:32,833
Mom packed a banana for me, too.

98
00:04:32,833 --> 00:04:35,000
As long as I have bananas, I’m afraid of nothing!

99
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:36,917
Smells delicious!

100
00:04:36,917 --> 00:04:40,083
Great! It looks like everyone has become friends.

101
00:04:40,167 --> 00:04:43,417
My mom prepared a little good-luck charm for me, too.

102
00:04:43,417 --> 00:04:46,917
She got this lucky fortune slip for me.

103
00:04:46,917 --> 00:04:49,750
She hopes my first day of school will be happy and go smoothly.

104
00:04:49,833 --> 00:04:51,833
Wow, it’s beautiful!

105
00:04:51,833 --> 00:04:56,000
Wow! Looks like everyone’s mom has her own kind of magic.

106
00:04:56,000 --> 00:04:57,417
That’s wonderful!

107
00:04:57,417 --> 00:05:00,083
All right, let’s all draw a picture.

108
00:05:00,083 --> 00:05:02,167
Draw how much you miss your parents.

109
00:05:02,917 --> 00:05:06,000
Everyone carefully put their feelings onto paper.

110
00:05:09,500 --> 00:05:12,083
Looks like everyone’s magic is ready!

111
00:05:12,333 --> 00:05:14,417
Let’s share our pictures with each other.

112
00:05:14,417 --> 00:05:17,083
I drew a planet with Dad’s big hand.

113
00:05:17,083 --> 00:05:20,000
This is Mom’s victory blessing.

114
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:22,167
I’m giving Mom a flower. Mwah!

115
00:05:22,167 --> 00:05:24,417
This is Mom’s special megaphone!

116
00:05:24,417 --> 00:05:24,750
What about yours?

117
00:05:24,750 --> 00:05:26,500
What about yours, Chuan-Chuan?

118
00:05:27,667 --> 00:05:30,417
Th-th-this is a warm, sunny sun.

119
00:05:30,417 --> 00:05:33,583
Just like my mom and dad.

120
00:05:34,083 --> 00:05:35,250
That’s wonderful, Chuan-Chuan!

121
00:05:35,250 --> 00:05:36,667
May, it’s your turn.

122
00:05:36,917 --> 00:05:37,833
Mm-hmm.

123
00:05:37,833 --> 00:05:38,833
I drew…

124
00:05:38,833 --> 00:05:40,333
Five hearts in a row!

125
00:05:43,417 --> 00:05:45,417
School isn’t scary at all!

126
00:05:46,167 --> 00:05:48,083
Yeah! It’s so much fun!

127
00:05:48,083 --> 00:05:51,083
Great job, everyone!

128
00:05:51,167 --> 00:05:54,083
When you miss someone, say “I love you” loud and clear.

129
00:05:54,167 --> 00:05:56,583
Remember to take your pictures home and give them to your parents.

130
00:05:57,917 --> 00:05:59,917
Thank you, Teacher Capybara!

131
00:05:59,917 --> 00:06:02,083
Hahaha!
